s://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good writing wise, can't speak to the factual correctness ","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114554#pullrequestreview-4616428064","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114554","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114554#pullrequestreview-4616428064"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114554"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-02T10:01:46Z","commit_id":"1db1bab0579cc76822a43b0b1059bc1c9fb99f05"},{"id":4620321801,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE2SECQ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I read this multiple times and I have to be picky, sorry. I had to rewrite this review multiple times because, as I tried to unwrap what this even meant, I kept coming to different conclusions.\n\nLike, let's slow down, take a step back, and think about it.\nThe problem is that **virtual methods from Object _may_ be called before a node is ready**, or even before it is inside the tree node. [The original issue is very specific](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113283), but the cause is way more generic and justifiable.\n\nI have no exact suggestions right now. I just know that, with the explanation I gave above, this new note is **way too specific** right now:\n- There's `class_name`, which doesn't have anything to do with it.\n- There's the \"Create New Node\" dialog, which doesn't tell the whole story.\n\t- What if a node is created in the editor programmatically?\n\t- If anything it makes it sound like a quirk deriving from the dialog itself.\n- There's `@tool`, which implies that it can really only happen with code running in the editor. But in truth it's just a quirk of Node.\n\nThe note also tries to re-explain information that could be (or is already) **alluded** to this description. Maybe some things could be rewritten, such that the natural conclusion from reading them would be \"Oh, of course `Object._get` is called here, but there's no parent yet, so it gives me this error!\".","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114554#pullrequestreview-4620321801","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114554","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114554#pullrequestreview-4620321801"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114554"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-02T18:41:10Z","commit_id":"1db1bab0579cc76822a43b0b1059bc1c9fb99f05"}]